=== chain.html
todos chain objects/ The chain 15 objects, tip first. Each names the objects it rests on. healthy — store.verify() reported no problems. Provisional writers untrusted actors: triage The triage agent reads attacker-controlled mail, so its writes are PROVISIONAL by construction (CLAUDE.md, Containment): recorded in full and surfaced here for confirmation, but inert to the lifecycle and pricing folds, so an injected mis-completion cannot silently close or reprice a todo. A provisional event binds only when a trusted actor re-appends it. Objects hash parents kind todo actor at fd954b57c01f37dae4785cb83b4af627582fbc33afe6e4448741aab8cd9af39c 00fa21ab9b80bb6439ba43548add59aa1b607ce2f800da2281def68d345d922e, 5e8fbe14abfd0cedc32a4d786b3f86c13ca1566c51d1ea45a34d316f8be35fc4 Authored file-permit ada 2026-08-13 12:00:00 5fbc855a3ee2607f0f8c4352fb436c27731d4a13bb6d3919110f6386db9f0e73 5e8fbe14abfd0cedc32a4d786b3f86c13ca1566c51d1ea45a34d316f8be35fc4, ce2daa2a7faad981190d0045efe947ae954f4245cf42cd29b523ef96fd323c00 Authored water-plants ada 2026-08-13 12:00:00 ce2daa2a7faad981190d0045efe947ae954f4245cf42cd29b523ef96fd323c00 5e8fbe14abfd0cedc32a4d786b3f86c13ca1566c51d1ea45a34d316f8be35fc4 Created water-plants ada 2026-08-03 12:00:00 b182b6e87e34b4a1373009d84f601d8ed7d1c7057f02c20f54f6a5514c82f53d 23b0484a9bef48f88e6871c170241041d0a7121a0fc19b62bff17b05447b4a40, 5e8fbe14abfd0cedc32a4d786b3f86c13ca1566c51d1ea45a34d316f8be35fc4 Completed renew-card ada 2026-08-14 12:00:00 6d7206c59206825db49152c912ffad406376011f0131d2fd6a9997727dbb264a 5e8fbe14abfd0cedc32a4d786b3f86c13ca1566c51d1ea45a34d316f8be35fc4, 933cee30e0663d4a0c1106eb18a0292a25d78aa94de2a2cac018b09f3d52d25c Authored pack-bags ada 2026-08-13 12:00:00 933cee30e0663d4a0c1106eb18a0292a25d78aa94de2a2cac018b09f3d52d25c 5e8fbe14abfd0cedc32a4d786b3f86c13ca1566c51d1ea45a34d316f8be35fc4 Created pack-bags ada 2026-08-03 12:00:00 6e7be820713bb7fa870f3b5aa39a96653c8c6387c56fd6968a138dccf6515311 449b6ff3ba4337a3895b01b6dec72bcc4569f996d4e46